OL,3,GNEWSAGive My Head Peace and The Blame
OL,4,AGame not recommissioned by BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FComedy shows Give My Head Peace and The
OL,7,FBlame Game have not been commissioned
OL,8,Ffor new series, the BBC has confirmed.
OL,10,FIt comes as the corporation attempts to
OL,11,Fsave #500m over two years as it faces
OL,12,F"significant financial pressures".
OL,14,FA BBC spokesperson said that while they
OL,15,F"recognise the significant
OL,16,Fcontribution" both programmes have
OL,17,Fmade, the BBC is "facing real financial
OL,18,Fchallenges at this time and will need
OL,19,Fto make some difficult decisions in
OL,20,Forder to manage them".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
